Package: weaveCompare
Type: Package
Title: Equivalence and Alignment of Periodic Binary Weaving Drawdowns
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Mark Joshua R.", "Secretario", email = "markjoshuasecretario@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Compares periodic binary weaving drawdowns using cyclic alignment,
    primitive rectangular repeats, exact canonical representations and Hamming
    distance on a common periodic domain. Optional reflections, axis exchange
    and face inversion define explicit equivalence rules. Supports collection
    distance matrices and duplicate grouping without requiring weaving design
    software. Comparisons describe binary interlacements, not fabric mechanics
    or cultural provenance.
